OL,5,
OL,6,FA selection of your pictures of
OL,7,FScotland sent in between 2 and 9
OL,8,FOctober.
OL,10,FSend your photos to
OL,11,Fscotlandpictures@bbc.co.uk. Please
OL,12,Fensure you adhere to the BBC's rules on
OL,13,Fphotography that can be found here.
OL,15,FPlease also ensure you take your
OL,16,Fpictures safely and responsibly, and
OL,17,Fthat they are not edited or enhanced
OL,18,Fusing AI.
OL,20,FIf you submit an image, you do so in
OL,21,Faccordance with the BBC's terms and
OL,22,Fconditions.
